Package: omarchy-pocket-uconsole
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Pocket Nexus <noreply@pocket.nexus>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libegl1, libgles2, libgbm1, zstd, curl, systemd, polkitd, util-linux, passwd
Recommends: lightdm
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://omapocket.org/docs/uconsole/
Description: Omarchy Pocket for the ClockworkPi uConsole
 Omarchy's CLI, themes and menu under one PocketJS shell on the uConsole's
 panel, beside Raspberry Pi OS's own desktop: the keyboard types, the
 trackball points with L and R as its buttons, and START is SUPER.
 .
 Omarchy's root, an Arch Linux ARM tree of 2.7 GB, is downloaded from the
 release when the package is configured. omarchy-pocket-session switches the
 panel between Omarchy Pocket and the desktop, now or at boot.
